<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centex reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centex reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it reinstated coverage of Centex Corp as near- and long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 32-3/4.</p>
</text>
